    {
      "block_id": 8,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "(Mirror— also appears in the interrupt request register.)\nWhen this bit is 1, there is data ready to be picked \nup by the processor. After reading the contents of this data \nregister, you must reset the INTF_RBF bit in INTREQ to prevent \nan overrun.\n",
      "bbox": [
